Design a Payroll Management System to manage employee salary records.  
Create a table to store employee details such as employee ID, name, and salary.  
Write a transaction that performs the following operations:   Begin a transaction  , Update the salary of multiple employees  
Create a SAVEPOINT after the first update   Perform additional updates   If any error occurs (such as invalid salary update), 
rollback to the SAVEPOINT   If all operations are successful, commit the transaction   
Test the transaction with different scenarios:   All updates successful   
Error after SAVEPOINT   
Complete rollback 
